      "id": "2084983604636156150",
      "text": "RT @MoreBirths: An extraordinary graphic showing what will happen in Poland if fertility rates simply  stay where they are. Most of the dev…",
      "created_at": "Wed Aug 05 12:43:23 +0000 2026",
      "lang": "en",
      "media": [],
      "retweet": {
        "id": "2084856017859317948",
        "text": "An extraordinary graphic showing what will happen in Poland if fertility rates simply  stay where they are. Most of the developed world is on a trajectory of population collapse similar to this.\n\nNothing matters more than turning around birthrate decline. https://t.co/owYlFIDhBU",
        "created_at": "Wed Aug 05 04:16:24 +0000 2026",
        "lang": "en",
        "media": [
          {
            "type": "video",
            "id": "2084856000104820736",
            "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2084856000104820736/vid/avc1/1184x716/JGbByHaQz3ImlTt_.mp4?tag=29",
            "bitrate": 2176000
          }
        ],
        "retweet": null,
        "quoted": {
          "id": "2084320001348009994",
          "text": "Let’s consider the demographic situation of Western Civilization seriously.\n\nIts core demographic base is about 750 million people, with a fertility rate of about 1.3 children per woman.\n\nWhat that means a few generations out is terrifying – we are DYING OUT.\n\nI did the exercise for Poland, which is about one twentieth of that demographic base, with a fertility rate at about half of replacement.\nFour generations into the future, it gives us this👇🏻 – basically the end of the nation.\n\nMultiply it by 20 and you get the fate of the whole Civilization. You do the math…\n\nOur only hope is in the families with 3+ children, who are able to pass that tradition on to their children.\n\nThey will inherit Our Civilization, if it survives. The rest will simply die out.\n\n(The same math that dooms the average saves the tail.)",
          "created_at": "Mon Aug 03 16:46:27 +0000 2026",
          "lang": "en",
