      "retweet": {
        "id": "2084998906702901758",
        "text": "Perfecting the overnight mode on Grok Build to keep the main agent context clean, dropping compaction from 3 times to 1.\n\nPrompt:\n\"Overnight mode on: <goal>. The role of the orchestrator is to a) make high-level strategy decisions, b) make sure sub-agents deliver useful information and keep going, c) validate sub-agent results (fan out another sub-agent as a validator), and make the next move.\"",
